					"content": "怎么样，信标都放好了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701040302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾斯特尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 701040302,
					"content": "都放好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701040303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701040303,
					"content": "实在是帮大忙了，这些报酬给你，谢谢你帮我这么多忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701040304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾斯特尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 701040304,
					"content": "唉，这么点信标，也不知道能勘测到多少有用的信息…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "艾斯特尔"
				}
			]
